  <ThingDef ParentName="RHA_RelicBase">
    <defName>RHA_Crown</defName>
    <label>Demon crown</label>
    <description>Grants +50% body health, direct damage and global work speed. Your contribution to eligible enemy defeats builds renown; each effective point adds 4% health, 4% damage and 3% work speed. The first 20 points have full effect, with diminishing returns thereafter. Stored renown stays with the item. Renown is calculated separately from other permanent marks. Share growth among holders of the same ability who contributed in the last 30 seconds, using each holder's own rate. Count damage, added stun time and Hex-attributed healing or shield absorption. Healing must repair recent enemy damage. If damage contributors are present, support takes at most 25% of the pool. Bystanders, ordinary animals, prisoners and finishing downed targets give no growth.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>RimHex/Relics/Crown</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <apparel>
      <layers>
        <li>RHA_CrownLayer</li>
      </layers>
    </apparel>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimHex.CompProperties_Prismatic">
        <power>Crown</power>
        <visualStyle>Solar</visualStyle>
        <visualColor>(1.0000,0.8588,0.5098)</visualColor>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>
